{"blocks":[{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2017/02/15/6858187/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"MARQUEEはもうチェックして頂けましたか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今回は、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"純奈をプロデュースしました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"黒が似合う純奈を女王様チックに..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひなは女王につかえる女かな笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2017/02/15/6858187/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この写真は、ふざけました(笑)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本誌では、\nめちゃめちゃかっこいいので\nぜひみてください！！！(｡•ㅅ•｡)❤︎"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"絵みたいに撮れてた...\nメイクも強めだしドレスだしセットもかっこいいし....インタビューページはスイカメンバーとの旅行について語ってます...ぜひスイカ推し(七瀬・純奈・川後・かりん・優里)には読んでほしい。"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2017/02/15/6858187/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"アンケも宜しくね！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2017/02/15/6858187/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"メンバーが今年に入り続々と写真集発売！\n嬉しい！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まいやんのパスポートめちゃめちゃ良かった〜\n美しい人を見ると目が幸せになるね！"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2017/02/15/6858187/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"表紙をイラストにしました笑\n画力どうでしょうかね〜？笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"他のメンバーの写真集もみたいな〜"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2017/02/15/6858187/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私も"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いつか出せたらいいな！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2017/02/15/6858187/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2017/02/15/6858187/0007.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"バレンタインだったので\n伊織とお出かけした時に\nチョコレートを買いました....幸"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"気分は、\n失恋ショコラティエの石原さとみさんだと思って\nお洒落に一粒ずつ食べてるよ...笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2017/02/15/6858187/0008.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"よし"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木中で紹介した\n湯たんぽで寝ます....\nみんなもお揃いにして\nぬくぬくで寝ましょう〜"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2017/02/15/6858187/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ばいぴち"}],"source":"archive"}